        "calls": 1,
        "text": "The AI assistant now waits double the usual time before giving up on a search of your files, so it is less likely to quit on large projects or slow devices. It also checks whether the search tool is actually missing before telling you to install it, meaning it no longer blames a broken installation when the real problem is a busy computer or a permission error. This makes search results more reliable and stops the assistant from sending you down the wrong fix for simple glitches.",
